    "Open-Yoink is a clean-room implementation that studied the observable behavior of several MIT-licensed open-source shelf apps (HoldMac, DropKit, ShelfMate, NotchPocket, nab, Dropshit). No third-party code is included. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in the source repository." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open-Yoink is a clean-room implementation that studied the observable behavior of several MIT-licensed open-source shelf apps (HoldMac, DropKit, ShelfMate, NotchPocket, nab, Dropshit). No third-party code is included. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in the source repository." } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open-Yoink 是一个净室实现，研究了多款 MIT 协议开源 shelf 应用（HoldMac、DropKit、ShelfMate、NotchPocket、nab、Dropshit）的可观察行为，不包含任何第三方代码。详见源码仓库中的 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md。" } }
      }
    },
